WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.748 --> 00:00:03.334
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Now, let’s go upstairs.

2
00:00:03.625 --> 00:00:08.424
Follow me. Be careful. The ceiling is very low here.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.844
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> It’s a very old house.

4
00:00:10.906 --> 00:00:14.729
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Yes, the house is three hundred years old.

5
00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:18.915
My family lived here for nearly eighty years.

6
00:00:19.735 --> 00:00:25.510
There are six bedrooms. This was my father’s bedroom.

7
00:00:26.528 --> 00:00:29.582
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Is there central heating in the house?

8
00:00:29.707 --> 00:00:33.342
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Yes, there is. Why do you ask?

9
00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:34.859
Are you cold?

10
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.757
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Yes, it’s very cold in here.

11
00:00:38.089 --> 00:00:40.603
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> That’s because we’re from California.

12
00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:43.698
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Let’s go and see the other bedrooms.

13
00:00:43.895 --> 00:00:45.453
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Yes, of course.

14
00:00:48.912 --> 00:00:53.752
Well, what do you think, Kim? I love it! Don’t you?

15
00:00:54.739 --> 00:00:59.268
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> I’m not sure. There’s something about the house I don’t like.

16
00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:03.579
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Kim, it’s perfect for the kids. Think of the garden.

17
00:01:03.807 --> 00:01:09.063
And it’s a real authentic English country house. What do you say?

18
00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:13.893
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> I suppose so. If you’re sure.

19
00:01:13.986 --> 00:01:18.297
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> I am sure! Miss…er, Barbara.

20
00:01:18.754 --> 00:01:21.911
We want it. We want to rent the house.

21
00:01:22.057 --> 00:01:23.220
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Excellent.

22
00:01:23.584 --> 00:01:25.121
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> When can we move in?

23
00:01:25.256 --> 00:01:26.960
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> As soon as you like.